# Not part of the deployment.
#
# reference/mockup.html is the original single-file static comp that
# this React app was ported from. It is kept in the repo as a visual
# comparison baseline, never served. Vite already excludes it — only
# index.html is an entry point and only public/ is copied verbatim —
# so this file is belt-and-braces against the output directory ever
# being repointed, and it keeps the upload smaller.
reference/
